flowchart TB
    A[Link time: gcc -lfoo] --> B{Search for libfoo.so}
    B --> C[Check -L paths]
    C --> D{Found?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Link OK]
    D -->|No| F[Check standard paths]
    F --> G[/usr/lib, /usr/local/lib, /lib]
    G --> H{Found?}
    H -->|Yes| E
    H -->|No| I[Error: cannot find -lfoo]
    
    J[Runtime: ./prog] --> K{Load libfoo.so}
    K --> L[Check RPATH/RUNPATH]
    L --> M{Found?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Load library]
    M -->|No| O[Check LD_LIBRARY_PATH]
    O --> P{Found?}
    P -->|Yes| N
    P -->|No| Q[Check /etc/ld.so.cache]
    Q --> R{Found?}
    R -->|Yes| N
    R -->|No| S[Error: cannot open shared object]
    
    style E fill:#c8e6c9
    style N fill:#c8e6c9
    style I fill:#ef9a9a
    style S fill:#ef9a9a
